{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17652","headline":"酬彭州萧使君秋中言怀 · 羊士谔","name":"酬彭州萧使君秋中言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"右职移青绶，雄藩拜紫泥。\n江回玉垒下，气爽锦城西。\n臯鹤惊秋律，琴乌怨夜啼。\n离居同舍念，宿昔奉金闺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}